text.en:
There is hereby created in the Province of Isabela, a municipality to be known as Quirino, to consist of the following barrio and sitios of the municipalities of Ilagan, Roxas and Gamu, same province:
From the municipality of Ilagan, the barrios of Sta. Lucia, San Mateo, Sto. Domingo, Santiago, Manaoag, Vintar, Dolores, and San Jose;
From the municipality of Roxas, the barrio and sitio of Camaal; and From the municipality of Gamu, the barrios and sitios of Luna, Suerte, San Juan, Binarsang, Sta. Catalina, Cabaruan and Sinait.
